<Slide notes={`这一节有六个知识块，都在回答同一个问题：这次分工到底换来了什么。

第一步先判断值不值得拆，给每个角色写清任务、输入、工具、输出合同和结束条件。第二步用最朴素的方式落地，也就是普通的 Responses 调用，两次独立审阅加一次汇总，不急着引入协作框架。

第三步讲交接：交出去的是证据，不是摘要，范围、来源和适用时段都不能丢。第四步比较固定工作流和自主协作，看谁在决定步骤。

第五步把目光移到产品里，看 WorkBuddy 的专家与专家团，同时记住权限不会自动变大。最后一步用同一任务集判断协作值不值得保留。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>本节导读</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>本节要看清的六件事</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 340, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>先证明拆分值得，再谈怎么拆</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#26816B' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>六个知识块从"要不要拆"走到"值不值得留"：先给角色写合同，再用普通调用落地，然后讲清交接证据、步骤由谁决定、产品里怎么看，最后用同一任务集验收。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 11 }}>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>先判断是否值得拆分</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>减少遗漏、隔离上下文、缩短独立等待，三者之一才值得</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>02</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>用 OpenAI API 实现最小分工</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>两次独立审阅加一次汇总，普通 Responses 调用即可</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#26816B', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>交接的是证据，不只是摘要</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>结论、来源、适用时段、证据与未解决项都要带上</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#26816B', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>04</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>工作流和自主协作的差异</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>程序预先规定步骤，还是协调者按任务动态选择</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>05</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>在 WorkBuddy 中使用专家与专家团</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>看真实分工与汇总产物，专家角色不自动获得权限</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#CB6B28', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>06</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>如何判断协作值得保留</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>同一任务集比较正确率、漏检、误报、Token 与耗时</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.12 多 Agent 协作与工作流</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>02 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
